#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service."
msgstr "Pelajari tentang event pelacakan aktivitas untuk IBM Quantum System Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service"
msgstr "Event pelacakan aktivitas untuk IBM Quantum System Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr "Event pelacakan aktivitas untuk IBM Quantum System Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum&reg; System Service, generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr "Layanan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti IBM Quantum&reg; System Service, menghasilkan event pelacakan aktivitas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit requirements.\n"
msgstr "Event pelacakan aktivitas melaporkan aktivitas yang mengubah status layanan di IBM Cloud. Kamu bisa menggunakan event ini untuk menginvestigasi aktivitas yang mencurigakan, tindakan kritis, dan untuk memenuhi persyaratan audit regulasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, layanan platform, untuk merutekan event auditing di akunmu ke tujuan yang Anda pilih dengan mengonfigurasi target dan rute yang menentukan ke mana event pelacakan aktivitas dikirim. Untuk info lebih lanjut, lihat [Tentang IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan IBM Cloud Logs untuk memvisualisasikan dan memberi peringatan pada event yang dihasilkan di akunmu dan diroute oleh IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing ke instance IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr "Melihat event pelacakan aktivitas untuk IBM Quantum System Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Meluncurkan IBM Cloud Logs dari halaman Observability {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr "Untuk info tentang cara meluncurkan UI IBM Cloud Logs, lihat [Meluncurkan UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) di dokumentasi IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

